<title>USA: Aceto names Schwartz as CEO and chairman.</title>
<headline>Aceto names Schwartz as CEO and chairman.</headline>
<dateline>LAKE SUCCESS, N.Y. 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Aceto Corp said Thursday that Leonard Schwartz, 51, president, was also named chief executive officer and chairman, effective July 1. Schwartz joined Aceto in 1969 and has been president since 1996.</p>
<p>He will replace Arnold Frankel who is retiring from these positions. Frankel, 75, co-founded Aceto 50 years ago, in 1947.</p>
<p>Aceto is an international marketer of fine, industrial and pharmaceutical chemicals.</p>
</text>
